WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:05.650
My Name is Josiah Lippincott. I'm from Tulare
California. I'm a Politics major at Hillsdale

00:00:05.650 --> 00:00:11.000
College. This spring I'm interning with the
Heritage Foundation in Washington DC as part

00:00:11.000 --> 00:00:13.900
of the Washington Hillsdale Internship Program. We

00:00:13.900 --> 00:00:18.800
call it WHIP for short, we bring anywhere
between ten to twenty students a semester

00:00:18.800 --> 00:00:23.180
out to DC. They take two or three classes
and they intern on the hill, at the Heritage

00:00:23.180 --> 00:00:28.269
Foundation, really anywhere they want to.
When we find somebody coming out of college

00:00:28.269 --> 00:00:33.630
who has some practical real world experience,
especially experience that applies to what

00:00:33.630 --> 00:00:39.079
we do, it really sets them apart. Washington
is one of those places that kids can learn

00:00:39.079 --> 00:00:44.530
a lot and gain a lot just from being hear
a few moths. And in that since, coming here

00:00:44.530 --> 00:00:48.420
and having that interning experience I guarantee
will be life changing.

